      "name": "FShapePairParticlePairMidPhase",
      "category": "ParticlePairMidPhase",
      "signature": "FShapePairParticlePairMidPhase()",
      "params": [],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "A midphase for a particle pair that pre-builds a set of all potentially colliding shape\npairs. This is the fast path used when each particle has a small number of shapes and\ndoes not contain a complex hierarchy. This midphase (compared to FGenericParticlePairMidPhase)\ncaches various data like the results of the collision filtering, the shapr pair types, etc."
    },
